<%# ============================================================================
    THE sidebar navigation — ONE source of truth, included by dashboard.html
    AND todaysbooking.html (Today's Booking is its own page).

    Both copies used to be maintained by hand and silently drifted: Notes,
    Applications and Affiliates existed only in the dashboard, so the menu
    changed depending on which page you were on. Add a section HERE and it
    appears in both, forever.

    Every item calls navTo('<page>'); each page defines navTo() for itself —
    the dashboard switches section in place, Today's Booking navigates.
    Access filtering still runs per page (admin-only: users / log / notes).
   ============================================================================ %>
